MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Best of Carly Simon feels like a natural next choice because melodic vocal songwriting connects with what appealed to me about The Bang Years.",
    "Traveller fits my interest in country recordings such as 747 and Golden, while Motown - The Musical - Originals connects with my enjoyment of Stages and A Musical Affair."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Earth Wind & Fire Greatest Hits, Blues With Friends and Ultimate Hits: Rock And Roll Never Forgets do not fit my current interest in gentle vocals, orchestral music and theatrical recordings closely enough for me to choose them.",
    "I cannot confidently connect Something Beautiful, Platinum, Number 1's ECOPAK or Oscd Ku Ripcord 2016 to my tastes without knowing the artist or songs; my hesitation does not mean I dislike their music."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The selections seem to assume that enjoying some familiar melodic recordings means I want greatest-hits collections across a broad range of musical styles.",
    "My interest in country music seems to have been stretched toward rock and blues, although those do not offer the same appeal for me during this visit."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated interest in Downton Abbey music, A Musical Affair, Under One Sky, Amor & Pasion, Stages and Lead With Your Heart suggests that expressive vocals and orchestral or theatrical settings deserve more attention.",
    "My latest choice, The Most Relaxing Classical Music in the Universe, gives a reason to favor calmer listening, while my country selections still leave room for a closely related country recording."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in melodic vocals, country and musicals, but stretched that interest too broadly into rock, blues and compilations I could not confidently identify."
}
